     1582   define variable vss-include-info13 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1583   on f5 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere
     1584   do:
     1585      v-doc-rec = recid(X_dis-tot_obj).    RUn OpenBR in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).  REPOSITION br-dis-tot_obj to recid v-doc-rec No-ERROR.   apply 'value-changed' to br-dis-tot_obj.
     1586       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to br-dis-tot_.
